    "body": "Confirmed in a clean launch: shops, shop icons, and clerk interactions work with UWO disabled. Safe Mode had already shown that suspending GameplayTweaks did not restore them, and the MyOverhaul data audit found no common shop-closing mutation. The remaining common cause was UWO, which injected behavior into shop owners. UWO remains disabled; no shop-state probe or speculative shop repair is needed.",
